{"type":"message","id":"d27386be","parentId":"5e57b222","timestamp":"2026-02-27T05:09:17.848Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Web search is failing. Let me try fetching directly from npm/github for more details or try different search queries. Or I could check if there's a Python package for this.\n\nLet me try another approach - I can search for \"genanki\" which is a Python library for creating Anki decks. But I need a reader, not a writer.\n\nActually, .apkg files are just ZIP files containing an SQLite database. I could use Python's built-in sqlite3 and zipfile modules to parse them directly!\n\nLet me verify this approach by examining the apkg file.","thinkingSignature":"e9068c4a427782ee64809314168bff2dfc46bf7160c0ffa3383627136614f2c3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3r7eud19vqh2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"file /home/one/projects/chinese_medicine.apkg && unzip -l /home/one/projects/chinese_medicine.apkg | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":4538,"output":171,"cacheRead":7877,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12586,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772168952629}}
