{"type":"message","id":"11df430b","parentId":"95e0b68a","timestamp":"2026-02-27T05:13:44.648Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me provide a final summary to the main agent.","thinkingSignature":"b7f5ccbddc1627bc99ac25551b18090b2c25188a97b195172fc7d2c18a874aee"},{"type":"text","text":"## 任务完成 ✅\n\n### 实现摘要\n\n**1. 选择的库**\n- 无需外部库！直接使用 Python 内置的 `zipfile` + `sqlite3` 解析 .apkg 文件（APKG 本质是 ZIP 压缩的 SQLite 数据库）\n\n**2. 实现的功能**\n- 新增 API 端点：`POST /import/apkg`\n- 解析 Anki .apkg 文件（ZIP 内的 `collection.anki2`）\n- 数据映射：\n  - Anki 字段 0 (`中药`) → Todo title\n  - Anki 字段 1 (`功效`) → Todo description\n\n**3. 导入结果**\n| 项目 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 卡片总数 | 286 张 |\n| 成功导入 | 286 张 |\n| 卡组名称 | 中药学 |\n\n**4. 测试结果** ✅\n- 示例导入数据：\n  - `麻黄` → `发汗解表、宣肺平喘、利水消肿`\n  - `桂枝` → `发汗解肌、温通经脉、助阳化气、平冲降逆`\n  - `芡实` → `益肾固精、补脾止泻、除湿止带`\n\n**5. 修改的文件**\n- `/home/one/projects/todo-api/main.py` - 添加了 Anki 导入功能"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":18747,"output":300,"cacheRead":7877,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26924,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772169217545}}
